    "created_at": "2022-03-29T12:38:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-03-29T12:38:31Z",
    "body": "OK I refactored again to use report inside the mime-type specific handlers. This makes more sense because for non-supported mime-types there is no reporting, and it also takes care of `X-Frame-Options` and `CSP`.\r\n\r\nOne issue that's not properly handled though is [TAO checks](https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/issues/1221).\r\n@domenic do you want to see if where I went with this reporting-wise is OK and then I'll add the TAO checks, which is kind of a separate issue, or should I try to add it to the PR first?",
